  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> »genius« is becoming a threading specialist </h1>",
   "body": "<p>Would you also like to measure tools with helical pitches non-contact, distortion-free, and μm-accurate? </p> <p>Expand your ZOLLER »genius« to »threadCheck«: Thanks to six CNC axes and the swivelling »orthoScan« multisensor optic carrier, you can automatically measure all types of cutting tools, quickly and with absolute precision. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3635\">ZOLLER Thread Measurement Program</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/7/csm_gewinde_b8c99b9ec0.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
