    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "Thread Measuring Program",
   "text": "<p>For metric ISO, ANSI, and Whitworth pipe threads</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3635",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Smart 24/7 Availability </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>ZOLLER »roboSet 2« – automates your »genius«. Performs cleaning, loading, labeling, and organization of your tools completely without manual labor.</strong></p> <p><strong>All measurements are fully documented. After measurement, the tools are labeled using ZOLLER »roboMark«—a laser flexibly marks the tool shaft within milliseconds with values determined individually during the measuring process and other data.</strong></p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/automation/tool-inspection/roboset-2\">Learn more about »roboSet 2«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/d/csm_genius_roboSet2__preview_8b281c6989.webp",
